        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Because our CyberKnife and TomoTherapy platforms contain both laser and X‑ray components, and because we assemble these components during manufacturing and service activities, we are also regulated under the Electronic Product Radiation Control Provisions of the United States Federal Food, Drug, and Cosmetic Act.",
        "start_character": 76872,
        "end_character": 77186
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-191242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-191242-94e2fff662707903",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-191242",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Because our products often have long development and regulatory approval cycles, we must anticipate changes in the marketplace and the direction of technological innovation and customer demands.",
        "start_character": 56715,
        "end_character": 56909
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-191242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-191242-94e2fff662707903",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-191242",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to these products, we also provide services, which include post-contract customer support (warranty period services and post-warranty services), installation services, training, and other professional services.",
        "start_character": 3343,
        "end_character": 3565
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-191242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-191242-94e2fff662707903",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-191242",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In direct sales markets, we employ a combination of territory sales managers, product specialists, training specialists and marketing managers.",
        "start_character": 45809,
        "end_character": 45952
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-191242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-191242-94e2fff662707903",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-191242",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In most territories, our distributors generally provide the full range of service and sales capabilities, although we may provide installation and service support for certain distributors.",
        "start_character": 47285,
        "end_character": 47473
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-191242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-191242-94e2fff662707903",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-191242",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The clinical success of our products is largely the result of the collaborative partnerships we have developed over the last decade with clinicians, researchers and patients.",
        "start_character": 6474,
        "end_character": 6648
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-191242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-191242-94e2fff662707903",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-191242",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also announced an agreement with TrueNorth Medical Physics LLC to provide radiation oncology departments with third-party support services that are complementary and supplementary to those already supplied by us.",
        "start_character": 10776,
        "end_character": 10991
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-191242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-191242-94e2fff662707903",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-191242",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide various incentives and recognition programs, such as equity awards, bonuses, service awards, and employee referral bonuses, to motivate and appreciate our employees.",
        "start_character": 103398,
        "end_character": 103579
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-191242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-191242-94e2fff662707903",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-191242",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are currently authorized to affix the CE mark under the MDR to our products, allowing us to sell our products throughout the European Economic Area.",
        "start_character": 97455,
        "end_character": 97606
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-191242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-191242-94e2fff662707903",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-191242",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are subject to additional regulations in other foreign countries, including, but not limited to, Canada, Taiwan, Korea, and Russia in order to sell our products.",
        "start_character": 99521,
        "end_character": 99685
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-191242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-191242-94e2fff662707903",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-191242",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are subject to unannounced inspections by the FDA and the Food and Drug Branch of the California Department of Health Services to determine our compliance with the QSR and other regulations, and these inspections may include the manufacturing facilities of some of our subcontractors.",
        "start_character": 74743,
        "end_character": 75030
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-191242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-191242-94e2fff662707903",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-191242",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We cannot assume that our competitors will not succeed in developing or marketing technologies or products that are more effective or commercially attractive than our products or that would render our technologies and products obsolete or less useful.",
